WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.960
A NETFLIX ORIGINAL SERIES

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.800
Why was that old lady
with the Capital Army?

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:21.020
There's a Minstrel Hunt. She sold us out!

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.020
No way...

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.820
Honestly, what a tough world we live in.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.910
Whenever I sing, bad things happen.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.160
Even though I love singing.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.500
Maybe I should stop singing...

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.000
Your singing cheers people up.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.170
That's what I felt when I sang with you.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.390
Pony Badlife...

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:57.890
It's Pony Goodlight.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.600
It sounds like I'm failing at life.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.470
My bad...

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.520
<i>Anyway...</i>

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.060
About the spirits that come
when you sing...

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.060
There they are!

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:11.440
Oh, no!

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.690
You must be the Minstrel.

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:17.570
You caused quite a bit of trouble.
Come with us.

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:19.660
And what if I say no?

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.700
Our Commander isn't the type of person
to go easy on anyone.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:26.080
I'd come quietly if I were you.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.920
Hey. According to our information,
the singer should be a girl.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.840
This woman definitely isn't a girl.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.180
What did you just say?

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.650
Did you just say I look old?!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:24.030
-Did you just say I look old?!
-She said it twice!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.410
The Song of Love

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.950
-What's with her?
-You're going to fight us?

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:33.040
-Don't lose to a simple woman like her!
-Did you just call me "single"?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.330
I didn't say that!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.500
That's what I heard.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.010
-Damn!
-Wait! Don't kill her!

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.090
Capture her!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:49.310
Could it be...?
She's trying to help us get away?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.570
Don't be so full of yourself!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:02.900
Why is it taking so long?
She's just one woman!

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:08.290
But if she's the songstress,
if we hurt her, the General would--

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:09.700
Who cares?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.080
Do songs really have power?

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.460
I don't believe it.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.590
What a hassle.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.760
Al, what are we going to do?
We have to save her!

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:28.350
It's my fault.
I can't let this happen again!

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:32.980
Hey!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.690
Get up, woman.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:41.320
You're too old to be the girl
we're looking for.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:43.570
So...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.860
-No!
-Goodbye.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.670
-Is this yours?
-Yeah.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.000
Mr. Leobolt!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.130
Hey. Bow to him.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.760
No, no. There's no need.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.090
Here.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.010
My...

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:17.230
I'm going to show you a bit of magic.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.990
Careful, don't drop it again.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.740
Yeah! Thanks!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.510
What's going on?

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.930
It must be Prince Rudo...

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.560
-You're raising taxes again! Too much!
-That's right!

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:01.310
You should just live
a more humble lifestyle.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.160
Shut them up.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:11.450
Silence!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.120
War costs money.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:18.870
Who do you think protects you from
the other countries that threaten us?!

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.470
It's Mr. Leobolt!

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:28.800
Mr. Leobolt!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.140
Please do something, Mr. Leobolt!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.600
Can't you stop the war?

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.180
Hold on... Calm down!

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.440
I'll listen to what you have to say.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:41.100
It's Mr. Leobolt!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.490
Who does he think he is?!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:53.870
He's merely a knight!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.950
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.790
Why does he have
more supporters than me,

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:01.420
a member of the royal family?!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.340
It's temporary.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:07.170
They just support him
because he saved Ms. Finis.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.930
And now he's Finis's guardian knight.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.890
He's no match for you, Prince Rudo.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:22.810
Damn!

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:26.400
He's a nuisance!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:31.660
Pony!

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.660
Are you okay, Commander?

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.830
Damn! I can't open my eyes!

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.330
One more!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.590
Al, that was amazing!

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:48.130
It's an invention I made for festivals!

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.590
They're called Star Bombs!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.800
They looked like spirits!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:58.260
Spirits don't exist! The bombs are made
of oxidants, combustible materials--

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.100
Al!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:02.810
Hang in there!

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.650
You'll be okay. I'm going to heal you now.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:11.650
No, you can't sing!

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.950
-They'll find out about your power...
-Idiot!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.330
That doesn't matter!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.000
You made a lot of trouble for us,
you brats...

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.500
<i>A song that awakens</i>

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.840
<i>And calls</i>

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:35.260
<i>People repeat the song</i>

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.350
<i>In their hearts</i>

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.230
Is that... the Song of Spirits?

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.190
<i>I wish to shine love into the sky</i>

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.980
<i>From which the light has disappeared</i>

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.190
<i>Me? Go to the battlefield?</i>

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.900
The war has begun.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:56.360
You could save countless soldiers
with your Song of Healing.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.990
With my song?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:04.290
-Henry Leobolt, are you there?
-Yes, sir.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.750
Take Finis...

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.460
and have her rest at a safe location,

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:16.510
so she will be able to make full use
of the power of her songs.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.850
Will you be using the power
of her songs for war?

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:29.860
You seem to be very popular
with the people.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.690
But I have also heard
that you oppose the war.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:38.620
Does this mean you harbor treasonous
intentions against the royal family?

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.330
No, I don't--

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:44.120
Protect Finis with your life,

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.290
guardian knight.

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:56.170
Al!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.010
Rin...

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:00.850
<i>That girl...</i>

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:05.180
<i>might be able to draw out</i>
<i>the power of this song.</i>

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.020
Hey, hey, hey! Did you guys see that?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.980
It's her! She's the girl who sings!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.980
Capture her!

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:20.370
This is going to get me a promotion!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.710
Now that I've gotten a closer look,
that woman's hot!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.710
It must be my lucky day.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.670
With a closer look?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.760
That meathead has really bad eyes.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.430
Sorry, Pony.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:42.800
It's my fault.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.930
Are you moping again?

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:46.930
I thought I told you--

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:51.150
I know that I have
to do something about it.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:56.820
All right. I'm betting on you.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.030
Ready? Memorize this song
I'm about to sing.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:03.200
And...

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.290
You've got a good friend there.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.940
An expression like that can only mean...

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:35.570
If Prince Rudo found out...

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:45.490
It feels so good.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.160
You're right.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.790
I wish time would stand still.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:53.460
Yes.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:55.500
Oh, right.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.380
I had Corte bring some bread.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:00.630
Huh?

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.180
She's not here.

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.890
How unusual for her to leave your side...

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:11.430
Corte?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.440
I didn't know
she could ride horses so well.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.480
That's not Corte!

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.110
Miss Finis!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.660
Why are you doing this, Corte?!

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.820
No, that's not Corte!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.240
A beard! That's a man!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.500
Stop!

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:48.470
Did you memorize it? Rin.

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.060
But what am I supposed to do?

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.640
When I give you the signal, just sing.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:56.150
According to the legends,
that song has...

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.570
Hey, shut up. What are you--?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.570
What are you doing?!

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:08.950
Hey, you!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.450
-Tie them back up!
-Yes, sir!

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:12.750
There!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.380
-Fool!
-It won't reach!

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.420
You're so clumsy!

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.460
Come on! You ruined our plan! Idiot!

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:22.510
Al, you idiot!

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.470
Who's the idiot now?

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.180
What?!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.560
What?!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:37.100
My Star Bombs contain oxidants!

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:40.980
They don't need the oxygen in the air!
So, they work underwater.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.070
I got it. Hurry up and untie us!

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.530
That was amazing, Al.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.820
I'm confused. Are you smart or stupid?

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.910
But... everything turned out all right
in the end!

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.870
Don't underestimate us!
Don't let them get away!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.000
Rin! Are you ready?!

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.720
Miss Finis! Are you okay?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.330
-Pony!
-Don't worry! You'll be able to sing it!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.830
Here we go. Capture them!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:38.660
Rin!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.670
<i>Let the wind rage</i>

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.590
<i>After the wind rages</i>

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:49.180
<i>The light will shine in the sky</i>

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.850
<i>Arise Our Hope</i>

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.010
What is this?!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:56.640
<i>Let the wind rage</i>

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.980
<i>After the wind rages</i>

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.150
Damn! It's just a song!

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:05.530
<i>The light will shine in the sky</i>

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:10.610
<i>The wind sweeps everything away</i>

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.950
<i>Because it is the wind</i>

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.500
Amazing...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.380
Are...? Are you okay?

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.640
Did I do this?

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.760
When a girl who possesses
the power of songs...

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.730
sings the Song of Spirits
passed down through the legends,

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.060
miracles will happen.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.880
Is there a problem?

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.470
Everything's fine, but...

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:11.880
What is it, then?

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.680
You seem worried

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:17.310
about preparing the Star Song Festival
and the Court Orchestra.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:20.350
I'm not. The Graphic notation
has been handed over.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:25.060
When Alea Golt was still here,
the Orchestra was more organized.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.770
We have no time to worry
about people who aren't here anymore.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.570
I see you're in excellent spirits.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.040
The thing we talked about
will arrive soon.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:44.250
The war is about to begin.

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:56.510
I... With these hands...

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.180
I wonder if Corte is okay.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.060
If anything happens to Corte,

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.480
I...

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:10.650
How does the enemy's army know
about our movements?

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.360
There must be a traitor...

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.290
<i>As the flame burns</i>

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.090
<i>A fleeting heartbeat</i>

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:35.970
<i>As the flame burns</i>

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:39.850
<i>Memories melt together</i>

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:43.640
<i>Be a flame</i>

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:46.770
<i>That swallows everything</i>

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:51.730
<i>My dear flame</i>

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:52.900
It's a miracle.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.490
-Do you feel warm now?
-Yes.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.740
Good...

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.380
Miss Finis!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:15.050
In order to create something new,

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.340
my songs take something in exchange.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.510
They must be chipping away at my life.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.350
Why didn't you say something earlier?!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.770
You shouldn't have... for me...

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.400
You protected me with your life.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.570
So...

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:36.570
I wanted to sing for you.

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.350
Finis...

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.810
Miss Finis!

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.190
Corte?!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:13.110
The exit is this way!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.360
Corte!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.320
Miss Finis!

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.490
Miss Finis!

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.240
Corte! I'm glad you're okay!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.790
I'm so glad.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.000
Finis! Were you attacked by the enemy?

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.800
Your clothes...

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.300
You bastard.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.260
You put Finis in danger.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:49.310
No! He protected me!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:53.770
Shut up! You're removed
from your post as the guardian knight!

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:57.230
-Don't come near Finis ever again.
-No...

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:58.730
Take her away!

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.570
Wait.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.740
Listen to me.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.950
Henry has done nothing wrong!

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:08.910
Henry?

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:18.210
I heard you did well in your scuffle
with multiple skilled fighters, Leobolt.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.010
How do you know?

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:22.510
The war has begun.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:26.010
So, I'm sending you
to the fiercest front lines.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.430
Be prepared.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.990
I thought your songs were just
for healing.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.780
I never knew they had powers like that.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:45.740
She sang the Song of Wind.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:49.120
The Song of Spirits has four songs
in total.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:54.080
The Song of Healing is a special song.
The Graphic notation no longer exists.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:56.170
A special song...

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:00.500
However, the legends say
that the person who draws out

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:03.920
the power of that song
has a shorter life in exchange.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:08.300
Their body is eaten away gradually,
and they weaken.

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:11.390
No! I've never even had beef before!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.810
I've never had stew
with vegetables that melt...

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.560
I've never had a big, sweet pie either.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.570
Was her life eaten away already?

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.070
Just ignore her.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:26.700
She just loves to eat.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.410
I've been with Rin for a long time.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:33.370
She becomes more energetic
the more she sings.

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:38.330
It's the opposite of the legend...

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:41.090
Melting cheese.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.800
Fluffy omelets.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:47.180
Could you knock it off?

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:49.390
You're supposed to be a girl...

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:51.260
But...

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:06.570
What's that?

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.700
That's a weapon created
by the Capital Army.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:13.450
That's... a weapon?

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.710
The war is about to begin.
